# Rendered documentation site. Built from README.md and docs/*.md by
# scripts/build-site.mjs, so it is output, not source — the workflow rebuilds it
# on every deploy. `seo-log.jsonl` is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the record
# of measured search positions, and its whole value is being comparable over time.
site/

# Audit PoC scratch space. The verification scripts (audit/poc/*.mjs,
# audit/verify/*.mjs) and the reports are tracked; the fixture trees they
# generate, the copies of this project they clone, and captured command output
# are regenerable and are deliberately not.
audit/poc/*/
audit/poc/*.txt
